WEBVTT

00:53:59.454 --> 00:54:00.968
The internet in general:

00:54:00.992 --> 00:54:07.454
full of unbelievably powerful addictions,
attractions and ways to spend time,

00:54:07.478 --> 00:54:11.472
and including the offer,
apparently, of community.

00:54:11.496 --> 00:54:15.116
And so, so many people
are actually shifting

00:54:15.140 --> 00:54:19.814
their sort of potential
to form communities to online efforts,

00:54:19.838 --> 00:54:22.880
their Facebook friends, etc., etc.

00:54:22.904 --> 00:54:24.438
Is that part of what's happened?

00:54:24.462 --> 00:54:28.209
DB: Yeah, I would -- when you talk about
the desire to find apparent community,

00:54:28.233 --> 00:54:30.071
I would emphasize the word "apparent."